          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Your Trusted Partner for Advancing AI Enabling Developers to Accelerate AI on AMD Hardware Get access to exclusive resources, free AMD Developer Cloud credits, hardware sweepstakes &amp; more. Learn More about Get access to exclusive resources, free AMD Developer Cloud credits, hardware sweepstakes &amp; more. AMD and its Partners Share Vision for “AI Everywhere, for Everyone” Portfolio of AI products and deep cross-industry collaborations are turning the promise of AI into real-world impact. Read the Press Release about Portfolio of AI products and deep cross-industry collaborations are turning the promise of AI into real-world impact. Advancing Enterprise AI Accelerate AI breakthroughs with end-to-end computing solutions and broad technology partnerships. Learn More about Accelerate AI breakthroughs with end-to-end computing solutions and broad technology partnerships. \"> Why AMD Broadest Portfolio of AI Solutions AMD is the only AI partner offering CPU, GPU, and adaptive computing solutions, enabling optimized AI deployments tailored to your needs."
          },
          {
            "tag": "h3",
            "text": "Open Ecosystem Approach"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "A commitment to open standards and co-innovation fosters flexibility and investment protection, giving you the confidence to deploy AI end-to-end."
          },
          {
            "tag": "h3",
            "text": "Proven Leadership in Innovation"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "AMD delivers industry-leading TCO, efficiency, and advanced AI – providing enterprise performance, reliability, and scalability for the data center, edge, and end user."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Leading Businesses Trust AMD A Comprehensive AI Portfolio End-to-end AI solutions across data center, edge, and endpoints"
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Data Center AI Accelerate AI deployment on-prem and in the cloud with AMD GPUs, CPUs, and more – coupled with industry-leading systems design expertise."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "Edge AI Integrate and accelerate a wide range of embedded, AI-driven applications by leveraging the advanced capabilities of powerful AMD APUs and SOCs."
          },
          {
            "tag": "p",
            "text": "AI PCs Enhance productivity and unlock new levels of creativity with locally-run AI models directly on your PC – without compromising performance or efficiency."
          },
